"Principal Lesedi Saleh heads the CNH hero program."
"Students may use her first name only if they beat her."
"She is the retired hero Ghosten; another hero now uses the name."
"She is a U-type who ranked up from A to S: strong, fast, agile and able to phase for a time."
"She once phased into a thief's bedroom to recover stolen gear."
"She pushed for Alden Thorn's combat assessment and had people watch him all day."
